Photorealistic sprite sheet of industrial forged music notes, viewed perfectly straight-on, on a pure flat black background. Exactly six separate objects in one evenly spaced horizontal row, none touching, each fully visible with generous black space around it, all the same height: 1 a single eighth note, 2 two beamed eighth notes, 3 a quarter note, 4 two beamed sixteenth notes, 5 a half note with hollow head, 6 a single sixteenth note. Each is forged from dark hammered iron with bright worn steel edges, and its note head glows molten orange as if just pulled from a furnace. Consistent style and lighting across all six. Crisp focus. No staff lines, no text, no numbers, no labels, no anvil, no sparks, no watermark.
